% Daml intro, composing choices: assets, roles and an atomic trade
%
% The Logical English (for LPS) twin of a Daml project, written by the Daml translator
% from its source: each template a fluent keyed by the contract id, each create and choice an action,
% who may do what integrity constraints. The source is kept in sources/ (File > Show the Original in the
% Logical English editor, View > The original this was converted from in the LPS2 IDE).
% The ids of the contracts a command creates are places of its action: the ledger assigns them, a scenario names them.
% Who may do what, as one permission per command: the legal view
% (Misc > Legal View of This LPS Program in the Logical English editor, View > Legal view in the LPS2 IDE).

the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 6.

the actions are:
    *a party* creates the asset *an asset* with issuer *an issuer*, owner *an owner*, symbol *a symbol*, quantity *a quantity* and observers party list *an observers party list*; known as create_asset.
    *a party* creates the transfer proposal *a transfer proposal* with asset issuer *an asset issuer*, asset owner *an asset owner*, asset symbol *an asset symbol*, asset quantity *an asset quantity*, asset observers party list *an asset observers party list* and new owner *a new owner*; known as create_transfer_proposal.
    *a party* creates the transfer approval *a transfer approval* with asset issuer *an asset issuer*, asset owner *an asset owner*, asset symbol *an asset symbol*, asset quantity *an asset quantity*, asset observers party list *an asset observers party list* and new owner *a new owner*; known as create_transfer_approval.
    *a party* creates the asset holder invite *an asset holder invite* with issuer *an issuer* and owner *an owner*; known as create_asset_holder_invite.
    *a party* creates the asset holder *an asset holder* with issuer *an issuer* and owner *an owner*; known as create_asset_holder.
    *a party* creates the trade *a trade* with base asset cid *a base asset cid*, base asset issuer *a base asset issuer*, base asset owner *a base asset owner*, base asset symbol *a base asset symbol*, base asset quantity *a base asset quantity*, base asset observers party list *a base asset observers party list*, quote approval cid *a quote approval cid*, quote asset issuer *a quote asset issuer*, quote asset owner *a quote asset owner*, quote asset symbol *a quote asset symbol*, quote asset quantity *a quote asset quantity* and quote asset observers party list *a quote asset observers party list*; known as create_trade.
    *a party* archives the asset *an asset*; known as archive_asset.
    *a party* archives the transfer proposal *a transfer proposal*; known as archive_transfer_proposal.
    *a party* archives the transfer approval *a transfer approval*; known as archive_transfer_approval.
    *a party* archives the asset holder invite *an asset holder invite*; known as archive_asset_holder_invite.
    *a party* archives the asset holder *an asset holder*; known as archive_asset_holder.
    *a party* archives the trade *a trade*; known as archive_trade.
    *a party* exercises split on the asset *an asset* with split quantity *a split quantity* creating *a second asset* and *a third asset*; known as split.
    *a party* exercises merge on the asset *an asset* with other cid *an other cid* creating *a second asset*; known as merge.
    *a party* exercises propose transfer on the asset *an asset* with new owner *a new owner* creating *a transfer proposal*; known as propose_transfer.
    *a party* exercises set observers on the asset *an asset* with new observers party list *a new observers party list* creating *a second asset*; known as set_observers.
    *a party* exercises accept on the transfer proposal *a transfer proposal* creating *an asset*; known as transfer_proposal_accept.
    *a party* exercises cancel on the transfer proposal *a transfer proposal* creating *an asset*; known as transfer_proposal_cancel.
    *a party* exercises reject on the transfer proposal *a transfer proposal* creating *an asset*; known as transfer_proposal_reject.
    *a party* exercises cancel on the transfer approval *a transfer approval*; known as transfer_approval_cancel.
    *a party* exercises reject on the transfer approval *a transfer approval*; known as transfer_approval_reject.
    *a party* exercises transfer on the transfer approval *a transfer approval* with asset cid *an asset cid* creating *an asset*; known as transfer_approval_transfer.
    *a party* exercises accept on the asset holder invite *an asset holder invite* creating *an asset holder*; known as asset_holder_invite_accept.
    *a party* exercises issue asset on the asset holder *an asset holder* with symbol *a symbol* and quantity *a quantity* creating *an asset*; known as issue_asset.
    *a party* exercises accept transfer on the asset holder *an asset holder* with transfer proposal cid *a transfer proposal cid* creating *an asset*; known as accept_transfer.
    *a party* exercises preapprove transfer on the asset holder *an asset holder* with asset issuer *an asset issuer*, asset owner *an asset owner*, asset symbol *an asset symbol*, asset quantity *an asset quantity* and asset observers party list *an asset observers party list* creating *a transfer approval*; known as preapprove_transfer.
    *a party* exercises cancel on the trade *a trade*; known as trade_cancel.
    *a party* exercises reject on the trade *a trade*; known as trade_reject.
    *a party* exercises settle on the trade *a trade* with quote asset cid *a quote asset cid* and base approval cid *a base approval cid* creating *an asset* and *a second asset*; known as trade_settle.

the fluents are:
    *an asset* is an asset with issuer *an issuer*, owner *an owner*, symbol *a symbol*, quantity *a quantity* and observers party list *an observers party list*; known as asset.
    *a transfer proposal* is a transfer proposal with asset issuer *an asset issuer*, asset owner *an asset owner*, asset symbol *an asset symbol*, asset quantity *an asset quantity*, asset observers party list *an asset observers party list* and new owner *a new owner*; known as transfer_proposal.
    *a transfer approval* is a transfer approval with asset issuer *an asset issuer*, asset owner *an asset owner*, asset symbol *an asset symbol*, asset quantity *an asset quantity*, asset observers party list *an asset observers party list* and new owner *a new owner*; known as transfer_approval.
    *an asset holder invite* is an asset holder invite with issuer *an issuer* and owner *an owner*; known as asset_holder_invite.
    *an asset holder* is an asset holder with issuer *an issuer* and owner *an owner*; known as asset_holder.
    *a trade* is a trade with base asset cid *a base asset cid*, base asset issuer *a base asset issuer*, base asset owner *a base asset owner*, base asset symbol *a base asset symbol*, base asset quantity *a base asset quantity*, base asset observers party list *a base asset observers party list*, quote approval cid *a quote approval cid*, quote asset issuer *a quote asset issuer*, quote asset owner *a quote asset owner*, quote asset symbol *a quote asset symbol*, quote asset quantity *a quote asset quantity* and quote asset observers party list *a quote asset observers party list*; known as trade.

