% Asset: a party creates one; its signatories must be the one who submits (Daml's authorization)
when a party creates the asset an asset with issuer an issuer, owner an owner, symbol a symbol, quantity a quantity and observers party list an observers party list
then the asset is an asset with issuer the issuer, owner the owner, symbol the symbol, quantity the quantity and observers party list the observers party list.

it must not be true that
    a party creates the asset an asset with issuer an issuer, owner an owner, symbol a symbol, quantity a quantity and observers party list an observers party list
    and the party is different from the issuer.

it must not be true that
    a party creates the asset an asset with issuer an issuer, owner an owner, symbol a symbol, quantity a quantity and observers party list an observers party list
    and the party is different from the owner.

it must not be true that
    a party creates the asset an asset with issuer an issuer, owner an owner, symbol a symbol, quantity a quantity and observers party list an observers party list
    and the quantity <= 0.0.

it must not be true that
    a party creates the asset an asset with issuer an issuer, owner an owner, symbol a symbol, quantity a quantity and observers party list an observers party list
    and the asset is an asset with issuer a second issuer, owner a second owner, symbol a second symbol, quantity a second quantity and observers party list a second observers party list.

% Asset: archiving one (Daml's Archive choice) is for its signatories, and it must be active
when a party archives the asset an asset
    and the asset is an asset with issuer an issuer, owner an owner, symbol a symbol, quantity a quantity and observers party list an observers party list
then it is not the case that the asset is an asset with issuer the issuer, owner the owner, symbol the symbol, quantity the quantity and observers party list the observers party list.

it must not be true that
    a party archives the asset an asset
    and the asset is an asset with issuer an issuer, owner an owner, symbol a symbol, quantity a quantity and observers party list an observers party list
    and the party is different from the issuer.

it must not be true that
    a party archives the asset an asset
    and the asset is an asset with issuer an issuer, owner an owner, symbol a symbol, quantity a quantity and observers party list an observers party list
    and the party is different from the owner.

it must not be true that
    a party archives the asset an asset
    and it is not the case that the asset is an asset with issuer an issuer, owner an owner, symbol a symbol, quantity a quantity and observers party list an observers party list.

% Asset.Split (consuming): the controller (owner) must submit it, and the contract must be active
when a party exercises split on the asset an asset with split quantity a split quantity creating a second asset and a third asset
    and the asset is an asset with issuer an issuer, owner an owner, symbol a symbol, quantity a quantity and observers party list an observers party list
then the second asset is an asset with issuer the issuer, owner the owner, symbol the symbol, quantity the split quantity and observers party list the observers party list
    and it is not the case that the asset is an asset with issuer the issuer, owner the owner, symbol the symbol, quantity the quantity and observers party list the observers party list.

when a party exercises split on the asset an asset with split quantity a split quantity creating a second asset and a third asset
    and the asset is an asset with issuer an issuer, owner an owner, symbol a symbol, quantity a second quantity and observers party list an observers party list
    and a quantity = second quantity - split quantity
then the third asset is an asset with issuer the issuer, owner the owner, symbol the symbol, quantity the quantity and observers party list the observers party list.

it must not be true that
    a party exercises split on the asset an asset with split quantity a split quantity creating a second asset and a third asset
    and the asset is an asset with issuer an issuer, owner an owner, symbol a symbol, quantity a quantity and observers party list an observers party list
    and the party is different from the owner.

it must not be true that
    a party exercises split on the asset an asset with split quantity a split quantity creating a second asset and a third asset
    and it is not the case that the asset is an asset with issuer an issuer, owner an owner, symbol a symbol, quantity a quantity and observers party list an observers party list.

it must not be true that
    a party exercises split on the asset an asset with split quantity a split quantity creating a second asset and a third asset
    and the asset is an asset with issuer an issuer, owner an owner, symbol a symbol, quantity a quantity and observers party list an observers party list
    and the split quantity <= 0.0.

it must not be true that
    a party exercises split on the asset an asset with split quantity a split quantity creating a second asset and a third asset
    and the asset is an asset with issuer an issuer, owner an owner, symbol a symbol, quantity a quantity and observers party list an observers party list
    and quantity - split quantity <= 0.0.

% Asset.Merge (consuming): the controller (owner) must submit it, and the contract must be active
when a party exercises merge on the asset an asset with other cid a cid creating a second asset
    and the cid is an asset with issuer a second issuer, owner a second owner, symbol a second symbol, quantity a second quantity and observers party list a second observers party list
    and the asset is an asset with issuer a third issuer, owner a third owner, symbol a third symbol, quantity a third quantity and observers party list a third observers party list
    and the cid is an asset with issuer an issuer, owner an owner, symbol a symbol, quantity a quantity and observers party list an observers party list
