then it is not the case that the asset is an asset with issuer the issuer, owner the owner, symbol the symbol, quantity the quantity and observers party list the observers party list.

when a party exercises merge on the asset an asset with other cid a cid creating a second asset
    and the cid is an asset with issuer a second issuer, owner a second owner, symbol a second symbol, quantity a second quantity and observers party list a second observers party list
    and the cid is an asset with issuer a third issuer, owner a third owner, symbol a third symbol, quantity a third quantity and observers party list a third observers party list
    and the asset is an asset with issuer an issuer, owner an owner, symbol a symbol, quantity a fourth quantity and observers party list an observers party list
    and a quantity = fourth quantity + third quantity
then the second asset is an asset with issuer the issuer, owner the owner, symbol the symbol, quantity the quantity and observers party list the observers party list.

it must not be true that
    a party exercises merge on the asset an asset with other cid a cid creating a second asset
    and the asset is an asset with issuer an issuer, owner an owner, symbol a symbol, quantity a quantity and observers party list an observers party list
