% Daml (the script run on a Canton sandbox) ends with these active contracts (their payloads;
% the ids are the ledger's):
%   - asset_holder(usd_bank,alice)
%   - asset_holder(usd_bank,bob)
% The twin's final state under LPS2 (`lps state`) is compared with it by test_daml.pl.
scenario setup_roles is:
    % the Daml Script setupRoles
    usd_bank creates the asset holder invite ahia with issuer usd_bank and owner alice from 1 to 2.
    usd_bank creates the asset holder invite ahib with issuer usd_bank and owner bob from 2 to 3.
    alice exercises accept on the asset holder invite ahia creating aha from 3 to 4.
    bob exercises accept on the asset holder invite ahib creating ahb from 4 to 5.

